    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d225">

                <pb facs="0288" n="218" sameAs="frus:frus1919Parisv01/pg218"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Paris Peace Conf. 184.82/13½</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chief of the Press Bureau</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Baker</hi>)
                        <hi rendition="#italic">to the Private Secretary of the Secretary of
                        State</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                    >Kirk</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Paris</hi>
                        </placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian" when="1919-01-03">January 3,
                            1919</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#flush">Subject: List of visitors.</p>
                <list>
                    <label>1.</label>
                    <item>I spoke to the Commission the other morning in regard to giving a daily
                        list of the visitors who have called upon the Commissioners, and the names
                        of those with whom the Commissioners have held conferences, so that the
                        newspaper correspondents can have some idea of what is going on. This
                        suggestion was approved.</item>
                    <label>2.</label>
                    <item>Will it be convenient for you if we have an orderly call at 6.30 every
                        evening for these reports? This is a system with which the correspondents
                        have become familiar in connection with visitors to the White House at
                        Washington.</item>
                </list>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Ray Stannard Baker</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
